  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 303.12 Notice to Department of Justice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 303.12 Notice to Department of Justice. Applicants or registrants required pursuant to Env-Sw 316.02(a) to provide information to the NHDOJ for background investigation purposes shall provide, with the information, a notice of filing in accordance with Env-Sw 303.05.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300) #8462-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
